                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><span class="userContent"><span class="text_exposed_show">Ajeeb shor hai<br> Ajeeb shor hai ...<br> <br> Ke shor me sukoon hai 2<br> <br> Ajab sukoon hai...<br> Ajab sukoon hai<br> <br> Sukoon me junoon hai 2<br> <br> Ye wo junoon hai<br> Ye wo junoon hai ...<br> <br> Jo deen ka sutoon hai 2<br> <br> Ya kya ye kyu ye kaise hai ye sochna haraam hai<br> sochna haraam hai<br> Kisi basher ki baat ka khuda ka khud kalaam hai<br> khuda ka khud kalaam hai<br> <br> "Fazkoruni azkoro kum washkoruni Wala taghforun"<br> <br> Quran mein khud kahta hai khuda<br> Wo mujhko kabhi jhutlata nahi<br> Aur mere shakir rahta hai<br> Jo mera zakir hota hai mai uska zakir banta hu<br> <br> Allah allah kar rahe hai husain<br> Ya husain ya husain ya husain Ya husain<br> Allah allah kar rahe hai husain<br> Kar raha hai Khuda hussain ya husain<br> Ya husain ya husain ya husain Ya husain<br> <br> 1)Khauf ahle sitam pe hai taari<br> Zikre shabbir ab bhi hai jaari<br> Jab khuda khud hai zaakire hai sarwar<br> Kaun rokega ye azadari<br> Ishk ka Tarjuma husain husain<br> <br> Kar raha hai khuda hussain husain<br> Ya husain ya husain ya husain Ya husain<br> Allah allah kar rahe hai husain<br> Kar raha hai khuda hussain husain ...<br> <br> 2) Kah diya aayae mawaddat ne<br> Hamse manga hai kya risalat ne<br> Ab bhi Aqlo pe hai pade parda<br> Raaze quran na samjha ummat ne<br> Rabte zahra hai ya husain husain<br> <br> Kar raha hai khuda hussain husain<br> Ya husain ya husain ya husain Ya husain<br> Allah allah kar rahe hai husain<br> Kar raha hai khuda hussain husain ...<br> <br> 3) uski baatil namaz hojae<br> Shak jo zaate husain me lae<br> Jo namaze khuda ko thukrae<br> Phir wo matam liye kaha jae<br> Hy Shaoore baka husain husain<br> <br> Kar raha hai khuda hussain husain<br> Ya husain ya husain ya husain Ya husain ...<br> <br> <br> 4) Kaise kaidi the karbala wale<br> Sheh ke maksad ko sath leke chale<br> Kab wo gaafil rahe hai sajdo se<br> Kaid mein bhi namaz padhte rahe<br> Aur jaari raha husain husain<br> <br> Kar raha hai khuda hussain husain<br> Ya husain ya husain ya husain Ya husain ...<br> <br> 5)Jab madine me aae ahle haram<br> Rozo shab tha husain ka matam<br> Ab bhi taarikh de rahi hai sada<br> Ghar me sajjad ke khuda ki kasam<br> Eid ke din hua husain husain<br> <br> Ya husain ya husain ya husain Ya husain ...<br> <br> Sada ye gaib se aati hai ibne zahra ki<br> Ye kaisi bahes me uljhi hui hai kaum meri<br> namaz ka koi munkir hai majliso ka koi<br> takallum aur hai darvesh ki tamanna yahi<br> khudara jism ko tum jaan se juda na karo<br> namaz aur aza ka tum mukabla na karo</span></span></p>
               
                                <p><p>Ay mere bhai raza, mai saniye zainab hoo<br>
Tu saniye hussain, ay ghareebul ghurba<br>
Ay mere bhai raza, tujhpe humsheer fida </p> <p></p>
<p>AY GHAREEBUL GHURABA, AY MERE BHAI RAZA,<br>
TUJHPE HUMSHEER FIDA , AY GHAREEBUL GHURABA</p>
<p>Tujhse milne ke liye kitne meelo ka safar<br>
Teri zainab ne kiya<br>
AY GHAREEBUL GHURABA.</p>
<p>1)Mujhko pardes my ye baat rulati hi rahi<br>
door hoo ghar se magar sar pe rida hai bhai<br>
binte zehra ne magar shaam o koofa ka safar<br>
be rida kaise kiya<br>
AY GHAREEBUL GHURABA.</p>
<p>2)Tera deedar bina bhai nahi reh sakti<br>
gham mai furqat ka teri aur nahi seh sakti<br>
kya mujhe bhool gaye tumko behna se milay<br>
ek baras beet gaya<br>
AY GHAREEBUL GHURABA.</p>
<p>3)Tumko zindan may kahi qaid na karle koi<br>
mere baba ki tarha zeher na dede koi<br>
jee nahi paungi mai sun ke mar jaungi mai<br>
tumko gar kuch bhi hua<br>
AY GHAREEBUL GHURABA.</p>
<p>4)Baap ki tarha mere sar pe tera saaya hai<br>
apni beti ki tarha tune mujhe paala hai<br>
tu hai ay bhai jahan mujhko bulwale wahan<br>
hoga ehsaan tera<br>
AY GHAREEBUL GHURABA.</p>
<p>5)Saath hum hotay agar shaam ko jaate bhai<br>
phir sakina ke liye ashk bahate bhai<br>
kya nahi tum ko khabar aagaya maahe safar<br>
waarise karbobala<br>
AY GHAREEBUL GHURABA.</p>
<p>6)Maut se pehle mujhe milne baradar aaja<br>
apni sughra ke liye ay mere akbar aaja<br>
dil may hasrat hai mere dekhloo chehra tera<br>
phir mujhe aaye khaza<br>
AY GHAREEBUL GHURABA.</p>
<p>7)Ay takallum ye behen bhai pe jaan deti thi<br>
sunke bhai ki khabar khaak pe ye aise giri<br>
lab pe tha haye raza dil pe kaabu na raha<br>
kha gayi usko Qazaa<br>
AY GHAREEBUL GHURABA.</p></p>